    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδαιμον-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call</i> or <i>account happy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδαιμόνιζε παῖδα σήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					268
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.7.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1096a2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.83
				</span></i>
			: c. gen. rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ . . μοίρας
				εὐδαιμονίσαι πρώτης</span> for his eminent fortune, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				144
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				516c
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτὸν εὐδαιμονιεῖ τῆς περιουσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.109
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τινὰ ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.7.3
				</span></i>
			 (s.v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.260
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					465d
				</span></i>
			,al.</div>
